s=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3598em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5152em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,9\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-144c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 是组合算子（如 TransE 的减法、RotatE 的旋转、DistMult 的乘法），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 根据边方向选择不同参数。</p>\n<p><strong>NBFNet / A*Net</strong> 实现了纯归纳的知识图谱推理——模型学习的是关系路径的组合规则而非实体嵌入，可泛化到完全未见过的实体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gnn-llm-融合-2026-年前沿\">GNN + LLM 融合：2026 年前沿</h2><p>2026 年最活跃的方向是将 GNN 作为 LLM 的结构推理模块。三种融合范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>GNN 角色</th>\n<th>LLM 角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GNN 编码 + LLM 解码</td>\n<td>GraphGPT、G-Retriever</td>\n<td>图结构编码器</td>\n<td>自然语言生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM 增强 GNN</td>\n<td>TAPE、OFA</td>\n<td>提供文本特征</td>\n<td>生成节点描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交替推理</td>\n<td>Think-on-Graph</td>\n<td>图上跳转导航</td>\n<td>推理与决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NVIDIA 在 2026 年明确将生态押注在 PyG 上（RAPIDS 25.06 移除 cuGraph-DGL），PyG 2.0 也原生支持了 GNN-LLM 融合的数据管线：通过 <code>torch_geometric.nn.nlp</code> 模块可直接将图结构输入给 LLM 做文本增强的节点分类或链接预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工业级推荐系统架构\">工业级推荐系统架构</h2><p>大规模推荐系统中 GNN 的部署遵循离线-近线-在线三层架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[离线层: 全量图训练] --&gt; B[日级更新图嵌入]&#10;    B --&gt; C[嵌入索引入库]&#10;    D[近线层: 增量图更新] --&gt; E[分钟级嵌入刷新]&#10;    E --&gt; C&#10;    F[在线层: 实时请求] --&gt; G[召回: ANN 检索]&#10;    G --&gt; H[粗排: 轻量模型]&#10;    H --&gt; I[精排: 深度模型]&#10;    C --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[离线层: 全量图训练] --&gt; B[日级更新图嵌入]\n    B --&gt; C[嵌入索引入库]\n    D[近线层: 增量图更新] --&gt; E[分钟级嵌入刷新]\n    E --&gt; C\n    F[在线层: 实时请求] --&gt; G[召回: ANN 检索]\n    G --&gt; H[粗排: 轻量模型]\n    H --&gt; I[精排: 深度模型]\n    C --&gt; G</pre><p>挑战集中在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>图的增量更新</strong>：新用户/物品加入时无需全图重训</li>\n<li><strong>采样策略</strong>：对十亿级图做邻居采样需要工程优化</li>\n<li><strong>嵌入时效性</strong>：用户兴趣随时间漂移，嵌入需频繁刷新</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pinterest 的 PinSage 开创了大规模 GNN 推荐的先河（30 亿节点、180 亿边），通过随机游走采样 + MapReduce 并行实现工业部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GNN 通过图扩散捕获高阶协同过滤信号，LightGCN 证明简单扩散已足够</li>\n<li>知识图谱推理中 GNN 可做归纳推理，泛化到未见过的实体</li>\n<li>GNN + LLM 融合是 2026 年最活跃方向：图做结构推理、LLM 做语义理解</li>\n<li>工业部署采用离线训练 + 增量更新 + 在线推理的三层架构</li>\n<li>NVIDIA 生态已全面转向 PyG，PinSage/LightGCN 是工业 GNN 推荐的标杆</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章节：<a href=\"social-network-fraud-detection\">社交网络与欺诈检测</a>展示 GNN 在图异常检测中的应用</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../network-graph-analysis/metrics/community-detection\">网络与图分析 - 社区发现</a>介绍了传统的社区检测方法，是 GNN 推荐中用户聚类的前置知识</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐系统与知识图谱","id":"推荐系统与知识图谱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协同过滤 GNN","id":"协同过滤-gnn"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱嵌入与推理","id":"知识图谱嵌入与推理"},{"level":2,"text":"GNN + LLM 融合：2026 年前沿","id":"gnn-llm-融合-2026-年前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"工业级推荐系统架构","id":"工业级推荐系统架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分子性质预测与药物发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/molecular-property-prediction"},"next":{"title":"社交网络与欺诈检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/social-network-fraud-detection"}}